#FFFFFF;\">18:05<\/strong>, o evento convida-te a correr ao final da tarde entre o centro hist\u00f3rico pombalino junto \u00e0 foz do <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Rio Guadiana<\/strong> e a frente atl\u00e2ntica de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Monte Gordo<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O tra\u00e7ado rainha de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">10 km<\/strong> possui homologa\u00e7\u00e3o segundo as diretrizes da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">World Athletics<\/strong>, oferecendo um perfil plano de asfalto ideal para atacares o teu recorde pessoal na reta que une a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Avenida da Rep\u00fablica<\/strong> e a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Pra\u00e7a Marqu\u00eas de Pombal<\/strong> \u00e0 ba\u00eda de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Monte Gordo<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Vila Real de Santo Ant\u00f3nio<\/strong> (distrito de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Faro<\/strong>). O programa inclui ainda uma <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria de 5 km<\/strong>, cuja receita reverte em 50% a favor dos <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Vila Real de Santo Ant\u00f3nio e Castro Marim<\/strong>, al\u00e9m das corridas gratuitas para os escal\u00f5es jovens (Sub-10 a Sub-18).<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pelo <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Jardim Funcional VRSA \u2013 Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva<\/strong> e pelo <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Munic\u00edpio de Vila Real de Santo Ant\u00f3nio<\/strong>, com o parecer t\u00e9cnico da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo do Algarve<\/strong>, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o distribui um *prize money* global de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">5.000 \u20ac<\/strong>, pr\u00e9mios de meta volante ao quil\u00f3metro 4 e um kit de atleta completo que inclui camisola de manga comprida, mochila e medalha de *finisher*. Esta prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sao-silvestre\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">5 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px;